; THE WARREN v2 (S1 seam 4, sl-0104): the Green dungeon interior at
; its bound entrance (the giant-skeleton mouth — access 194,240 on
; b77). A COMMITTED INSTANCE: authored spawns, no sites — cleared is
; cleared for the visit; walking back out and in re-commits it.
; Rooms fight ONE AT A TIME by distance discipline (iteration 1's
; entrance killbox taught that aggro crosses walls): each pack sits
; >12 t from the previous room's fight zone, shafts empty. KING
; GRUBB and his thinned court hold the wide throne room. Death costs
; the gold slice and respawns at the warren mouth — the tunnels are
; the walk back. Door wiring in main.gd; the ladder up is cell 2,2.

